Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.07,0:00:33.44,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}美味しいかもしれないな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.75,0:00:35.57,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}味は二の次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:36.86,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}もう潮時
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:42.62,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}なんだか頑張れないな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.46,0:00:44.90,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}ああそうか
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:49.37,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}もう頑張らなくてもいいんだって
